        <mxCell id="note" value="Note: original design routed distribution through n8n as a middleware layer between Airtable and the channel APIs.&#10;In the real system, Airtable Automation calls the FastAPI webhook directly, and publishing is a same-process&#10;LangGraph node (publishing_agent) — no separate integration/distribution service exists." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B85450;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
